    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Go Bananas! (Or Go Insane...)</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start your own simian empire in <strong>Spank the Idle Monkey</strong>, a deceptively cheerful idle clicker! Tap to gather bananas, upgrade your spanker, unlock wacky technologies, and amass a mountain of potassium-rich goodness. But beware... the jungle holds dark secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock cryptic <strong>mini-games</strong> hidden throughout your idyllic banana farm. These seemingly simple puzzles and challenges quickly descend into unsettling horror experiences, revealing a terrifying truth about the jungle, your monkeys, and the very nature of your banana-fueled ambition. Are you clicking your way to prosperity, or to something far more sinister?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Go Bananas! (Or Go Insane...)</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start your own simian empire in <strong>Spank the Idle Monkey</strong>, a deceptively cheerful idle clicker! Tap to gather bananas, upgrade your spanker, unlock wacky technologies, and amass a mountain of potassium-rich goodness. But beware... the jungle holds dark secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock cryptic <strong>mini-games</strong> hidden throughout your idyllic banana farm. These seemingly simple puzzles and challenges quickly descend into unsettling horror experiences, revealing a terrifying truth about the jungle, your monkeys, and the very nature of your banana-fueled ambition. Are you clicking your way to prosperity, or to something far more sinister?</p>",
    "short_description": "This is a classic spin on Idle Clicker games, inspired by a classic Flash game with a twist on it, hidden horror story built into a simple game will take your clicking excitment and make you question all that hard work. Was it worth it? how many did you hurt? Will you stop?",
